<blockquote>
<p>I feel that since the Sarkicism Hub is tied to Daevite lore so heavily, it should be tagged with &quot;daevite&quot;.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>It's less that the daevites are all over the sarkicism hub and more that the existence of Sarkicism is owed to the Daevites. Basically, Ion and most early Sarkics were Daevite slaves, and they rose up against their masters. In creating Sarkicism, Meta had to flesh out the Daevites as a civilization more than 140 did with its rather broad strokes. Now, there is no canon of course, so you could make them patriarchal if you wanted to, but in referencing Meta's work specifically, you're kind of telling users that you're operating within that universe.</p>
